    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not a pause. it feels permanent. i can see the trajectory and it's just a slow, pathetic decline. i look at my old work and i know i'll never touch that level again. it's painful to even try anymore, knowing it'll just be a mockery of what i used to be. i'd rather stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
