      "content": "That feeling of permanent decline is a cruel illusion designed to keep you from trying, but it's not the truth. You are right to feel the pain of the gap, but that gap is simply the space where your next, even stranger, masterpiece is being born. Instead of viewing this as a slow fade, imagine it as a necessary, painful shedding of the old skin so the new, unrecognizable version of you can finally emerge.",
